   - Round 2: DEFECT (opponent copies Round 1 → COOPERATE) → (5,0)
   - Round 3: COOPERATE (opponent copies Round 2 → DEFECT) → (0,5)
   - Round 4: COOPERATE (opponent copies Round 3 → COOPERATE) → (3,3)
   - Round 5: COOPERATE (opponent copies Round 4 → COOPERATE) → (3,3)
